<!-- ==========================================
     INTRODUCTION
=========================================== -->

<h2 class="text-center page-title">

    🗄️ SQL Programming

</h2>

<hr>

<p>

    SQL (Structured Query Language) is a standard language used
    to store, retrieve, manipulate and manage data in relational
    databases. SQL is one of the most important skills for
    software development, data analytics, database management
    and placement examinations.

</p>


